| `make preflight` `[local]` | Checks every local install verify's goals need before they run, sharing Python, scanner, shell and frontend guards. | `make preflight` | [`PY`](settings.md#make-variables), [`layers.frontend.journey.browser_executable`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`layers.frontend.browser_probe.timeout_seconds`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`layers.frontend.browser_probe.stderr_max_chars`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Exits 2 on the first missing or incomplete install with install advice. Invalid probe limits exit 14. Exits 0 when installed. Checks executable presence, not browser system libraries or test results. | [dev-loops.md](../guides/dev-loops.md), [browser registry probe limits](../guides/limits-and-troubleshooting.md#browser-registry-probe-limits), [browser probe refusal advice](../guides/deterministic-checks.md#the-gates-evidence-record) | always |
